      {
       "text": "Green selection markers in the shop app now disappear without delay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "No more pedestrians wearing Christmas hats in the outdoor area",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Auto-Restocking could sometimes not be toggled (the UI would change but the behaviour would not).: Thanks for playing our games! See you in the shop! ❤️: Stable regards,: Three River Games (3RG): Join our Discord! 💬: https://discord.gg/WpxwA9B8G3",
